sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(232,245,233) Host service
    participant A as Host code
  end
  box rgb(224,242,241) Rule Engine, in process
    participant E as RuleEngine
    participant C as Compiled cache
  end
  box rgb(255,248,225) Host PostgreSQL
    participant DB as rle_version, rle_decision, rle_decision_outbox
  end
  rect rgb(255,248,225)
    Note over A,DB: Host transaction, sync in-transaction step
    A->>E: evaluate("card-fee", input), tenant from resolver, clock from Clock bean
    E->>C: get(tenant, card-fee, effective at clock)
    alt cache miss or epoch moved
      C->>DB: SELECT effective version
      C->>C: parse, type check, compile once
    end
    E->>E: evaluate tree, no I/O, p99 under 100 us
    alt log mode transactional
      E->>DB: INSERT rle_decision, the only statement added
    else log mode async
      E->>DB: INSERT rle_decision_outbox
    end
    E-->>A: DecisionResult Matched, NoMatch or Failed
    alt host commits
      A->>DB: COMMIT, decision row commits with business data
    else host rolls back
      A->>DB: ROLLBACK, no decision row remains
    end
  end
  rect rgb(255,248,225)
    Note over DB: Async mode only: relay on the scheduler thread, own short TX
    E->>DB: SELECT outbox FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, INSERT rle_decision, mark SENT, COMMIT
  end
